---
import Church from '../layouts/Church.astro';
---
<Church title="Give" section="Pages">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <h1>Give</h1>
    <p>Giving is a way to share in the life of the church and its neighbors. Everything here is optional, and visitors are never expected to give.</p>
    <h2>Ways to give</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>In person, in the offering plate on Sunday.</li>
      <li>By check, mailed to the church office.</li>
      <li>Online, through the church's giving provider. <em>This concept site has no payment link, since the church is fictional.</em></li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Where it goes</h2>
    <p>Gifts support worship, the building, the food pantry, and the youth program.</p>
  </div>
</Church>
